00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.490 align:start position:0%
 
foreign  this was the moment caught on amateur  video cameras at 607 am local time in  Crimea purportedly showing a cargo track  exploding on the motorway parallel to  the catch Bridge the blast was so huge  flames and debris crossed to the other  lane and reached a fuel cargo train that  was passing by Russia's government was  quick to respond the speaker of the  state Duma described the incident as a  terrorist attack and an act of War on  Russia President Vladimir Putin has  ordered an investigation committee be  set up to find out who's behind it and  how it happened  the Kirch Bridge also called the Crimea  bridge is one of Russia's most vital  supply lines and its only land link with  the Crimean peninsula  it was opened by Vladimir Putin in 2018  four years after Russia annexed the  Crimean territory from Ukraine  the explosion caused two sections of the  bridge to collapse and several train  carriages caught fire  traffic on the entire Bridge came to a  standstill  the sea ferrying Arch under the bridge  was not affected but this will likely  pose several challenges for Russia's  capabilities to supply its troops and  other administrative operations in  Crimea  the Kirch bridge is less than 300  kilometers away from the nearest battle  sites in Herson and here in Mainland  Russia no one seems to doubt the  incident is directly linked to the war  in Ukraine and every finger of  accusation is pointed at kieval  al-jazeera Moscow

